PipeOpened [SimTalk]
Opens the Pipe designated by <Path> so that materials can flow through it (true).
Remarks
Use PipeOpened to model a valve or a gate valve to open and to close the Pipe.
To close the Pipe specify false. The Pipe then shows the state Pipe Closed in cyan.
State vertical State horizontal
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.PipeOpened:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
Pipe.PipeOpened := true
See also
Pipe Opened [check box]
PipeOpened [SimTalk]
